                                                "sense_id": "3ba1c2d8-b5fd-3955-91aa-a5a161abcd86",
                                                "text": "[…] the cocoa-nut tree yields a pure draught from a dry and barren land; a cup of water to the temperate and thirsty traveler; a cup of cream from the pressed kernel; a cup of refreshing and sparkling toddy to the early riser; […]"
                                            },
